WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 21]

01:57.310 --> 01:59.180
I never thought you'd be this shameless.

01:59.870 --> 02:01.740
Your technique is like a mind-deranging art

02:02.430 --> 02:04.100
meant to bait out the killing urge in me.

02:06.040 --> 02:07.740
Though you fought hard to hold it down,

02:08.710 --> 02:10.570
but with one look I knew

02:11.280 --> 02:11.940
your whole body

02:12.590 --> 02:13.820
reeks of blood.

02:14.560 --> 02:15.820
You are no swordsman.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.060
All these years,

02:19.030 --> 02:20.570
you've made a living by killing!

02:35.150 --> 02:36.410
When the sword stirs wind,

02:37.030 --> 02:38.730
he smiles as the clouds rise.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.570
So many years have passed

02:42.190 --> 02:43.450
and the Old City Lord's sword

02:44.030 --> 02:46.060
is still this effortless and free.

02:46.750 --> 02:48.010
But judging by the exchange

02:48.710 --> 02:49.500
I crossed with him just now,

02:49.710 --> 02:50.220
his swordsmanship

02:50.710 --> 02:51.690
shouldn't be that weak.

02:52.430 --> 02:53.010
So Master's training

02:53.090 --> 02:54.300
at the Sword Abode

02:54.310 --> 02:54.980
is starting to show,

02:55.630 --> 02:56.370
and his swordsmanship

02:56.800 --> 02:57.900
has climbed a level.

02:58.840 --> 03:00.530
You banked on no one seeing clearly

03:01.590 --> 03:03.140
and pulled a dirty trick.

03:05.800 --> 03:07.060
You headed east the whole way,

03:07.520 --> 03:08.460
keeping your blade sheathed

03:09.120 --> 03:11.370
to raise a swell of sword energy.

03:12.240 --> 03:14.020
Once your killing urge outweighed that energy,

03:14.470 --> 03:15.490
all that momentum dumped,

03:16.120 --> 03:16.740
and you lost

03:17.430 --> 03:19.140
the bravery you had.

03:20.120 --> 03:20.930
You're a shameless scoundrel.

03:21.870 --> 03:22.580
The Way of the Sword

03:23.280 --> 03:25.020
was what your father sought.

03:25.710 --> 03:26.420
And I

03:26.750 --> 03:27.580
seek only victory.

03:28.190 --> 03:29.020
For only the victor

03:29.390 --> 03:30.930
is fit to talk the Way of the Sword!

03:31.120 --> 03:31.810
The Way of the Sword

03:32.800 --> 03:33.970
is indeed the term

03:34.030 --> 03:35.530
my father often spoke of.

03:47.340 --> 03:47.860
[Sword]

04:04.100 --> 04:05.780
[Way]

04:07.590 --> 04:08.300
Sword...

04:09.630 --> 04:10.210
Way.

04:13.630 --> 04:14.250
Father,

04:15.710 --> 04:16.570
what is the Way of the Sword?

04:18.430 --> 04:21.060
By "sword" we mean skill and technique.

04:21.600 --> 04:23.660
How strong can a single blade be honed?

04:23.950 --> 04:24.930
First it strikes down ten,

04:25.390 --> 04:26.370
then a hundred,

04:26.870 --> 04:27.930
then a thousand,

04:28.310 --> 04:29.420
even ten thousand!

04:30.720 --> 04:31.660
We swordsmen

04:31.920 --> 04:32.740
train our blades

04:32.920 --> 04:34.250
day after day,

04:34.870 --> 04:35.570
hoping to push them

04:35.830 --> 04:37.490
to the utmost,

04:37.750 --> 04:39.060
so they can stand against all.

04:42.630 --> 04:43.620
I believe my sword

04:44.360 --> 04:45.100
has already reached

04:45.240 --> 04:46.780
its utmost strength.

04:47.830 --> 04:48.980
To take one step further,

04:49.800 --> 04:50.810
I must awaken to the Way.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.780
So what is the Way?

04:54.870 --> 04:56.540
The Kunlun Sword Deity once said

04:57.000 --> 04:57.740
his sword art

04:58.040 --> 04:59.180
has three realms.

05:00.000 --> 05:02.300
First realm, see mountains as mountains

05:02.680 --> 05:03.740
and waters as waters.

05:04.510 --> 05:05.660
Second realm,

05:06.270 --> 05:07.620
see mountains as not mountains

05:08.160 --> 05:09.620
and waters as not waters.

05:10.480 --> 05:11.570
Third realm,

05:12.070 --> 05:13.420
see mountains still as mountains,

05:13.720 --> 05:15.780
and waters still as waters.

05:19.310 --> 05:20.450
I pondered this for long,

05:20.870 --> 05:22.690
yet never grasped its meaning.

05:23.830 --> 05:24.660
But I believed

05:25.360 --> 05:26.250
the Way

05:27.040 --> 05:29.130
is simply a reason to draw the blade.

05:53.510 --> 05:54.780
So it seems some truths...

05:56.240 --> 05:58.070
reveal themselves

05:58.070 --> 05:59.220
only in one's dying moment.

06:03.630 --> 06:05.740
The strongest strike in a life

06:07.600 --> 06:09.660
may come only once.

06:11.950 --> 06:12.740
Sadly,

06:14.560 --> 06:16.180
I can no longer protect you.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.130
I just said

06:19.830 --> 06:20.930
people of Wushuang City

06:22.070 --> 06:24.690
have no right to speak my father's name,

06:25.750 --> 06:26.810
least of you!

06:27.000 --> 06:28.180
All that "flowing like water",

06:28.360 --> 06:28.930
break!

06:29.510 --> 06:31.060
All that "grandmaster aura",

06:31.390 --> 06:32.010
break!

06:32.720 --> 06:34.010
All that "peerless under heaven",

06:34.510 --> 06:35.740
all can be broken!

06:41.310 --> 06:42.810
The harder you kill now,

06:43.310 --> 06:44.660
the faster you'll lose.

07:04.800 --> 07:05.420
You've lost.

07:05.830 --> 07:07.330
You want me to use killing arts,

07:07.920 --> 07:08.890
but I refuse.

07:09.630 --> 07:10.130
Today,

07:10.510 --> 07:11.890
I'll beat you with the sword alone.

07:20.870 --> 07:21.490
It's him!

07:22.430 --> 07:23.330
You know him?

07:25.070 --> 07:25.980
He's Blood River's Umbrella Ghost,

07:26.680 --> 07:27.620
Su Muyu.

07:28.950 --> 07:29.780
Blood River...

07:31.000 --> 07:32.220
If he's truly from Blood River,

07:33.750 --> 07:35.890
then everything makes sense.

07:37.800 --> 07:38.570
Elder Jian,

07:39.190 --> 07:40.010
what do you mean?

07:40.430 --> 07:41.060
Are you saying

07:41.510 --> 07:42.540
Wushuang City and Blood River

07:42.600 --> 07:43.490
are entangled?

07:43.720 --> 07:44.370
And it even ties

07:45.000 --> 07:46.300
to No-Sword City?

07:46.950 --> 07:48.490
Sir, there's no need to ask.

07:48.950 --> 07:50.660
It's all in the past.

07:53.160 --> 07:53.780
Master,

07:54.040 --> 07:55.450
the sword coffer's slipping control!

07:59.190 --> 07:59.860
It only spotted

07:59.870 --> 08:01.100
a worthy opponent

08:01.800 --> 08:02.930
and wants a match.

08:04.950 --> 08:06.130
It's a pity you're still young.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.620
Otherwise, such an opponent

08:08.430 --> 08:09.620
is truly worth a fight.

08:10.750 --> 08:11.370
Master,

08:11.800 --> 08:12.620
what should we do?

08:13.160 --> 08:13.810
Don't worry.

08:14.190 --> 08:14.890
It won't be long

08:15.160 --> 08:16.180
before it settles down.

08:18.240 --> 08:18.890
Little Wushuang,

08:20.120 --> 08:21.220
when you're grown,

08:21.600 --> 08:22.690
take it to seek

08:23.000 --> 08:24.250
a worthy opponent.

08:25.920 --> 08:26.660
The Old City Lord

08:27.000 --> 08:27.860
is about to lose.

08:35.480 --> 08:36.660
He should have lost.

08:37.440 --> 08:38.380
Only this loss

08:39.480 --> 08:40.660
came a dozen years late.

08:42.320 --> 08:43.300
Had he lost back then,

08:44.030 --> 08:45.540
he might have risen again.

08:46.360 --> 08:47.300
But losing today,

08:48.630 --> 08:49.850
he loses for good.

09:00.200 --> 09:00.780
Here it comes...

09:00.870 --> 09:02.330
the Old City Lord's strongest strike.

09:03.750 --> 09:05.260
Riding the sword to the Ninth Heaven...

09:06.080 --> 09:08.090
The dragon falls into the Yellow Springs!

09:12.910 --> 09:14.420
You're the one who will fall!

09:26.630 --> 09:27.330
It's over.

09:33.200 --> 09:33.930
Jade Ruyi!

09:38.150 --> 09:39.540
Such pure sword energy!

09:44.120 --> 09:44.780
Master,

09:45.960 --> 09:46.730
why was the sword coffer

09:47.150 --> 09:48.300
acting by itself?

09:48.510 --> 09:50.140
It wasn't the coffer

09:50.150 --> 09:51.140
acting on its own.

09:51.550 --> 09:53.210
Without noticing,

09:53.510 --> 09:55.060
you stirred it.

09:55.600 --> 09:56.300
These last two days,

09:56.840 --> 09:57.900
I only taught little Wushuang

09:57.960 --> 09:59.420
some basic inner work.

10:00.750 --> 10:01.570
Did the Jade Ruyi

10:01.790 --> 10:03.330
shift the battle below?

10:11.670 --> 10:12.420
Stop!

10:24.440 --> 10:25.540
My killing intent has faded,

10:26.480 --> 10:27.300
and my sword momentum is gone.

10:27.910 --> 10:29.180
If you strike now,

10:29.720 --> 10:30.660
I'll surely lose.

10:31.000 --> 10:31.730
I know.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.970
But I won't hit a man when he's down.

10:34.910 --> 10:35.780
I only ask you

10:36.630 --> 10:37.900
to spare my master's life.

10:38.790 --> 10:40.300
Spare your master?

10:44.360 --> 10:45.380
Back when your master

10:45.400 --> 10:46.390
slaughtered everyone

10:46.390 --> 10:47.540
in No-Sword City,

10:49.310 --> 10:51.330
did he spare theirs?

10:52.830 --> 10:53.810
You're right.

10:54.670 --> 10:56.060
My master's deeds back then

10:56.390 --> 10:57.570
were truly unforgivable.

10:58.240 --> 10:59.570
But as his disciple,

10:59.900 --> 11:00.630
how could I possibly

11:00.630 --> 11:02.020
watch my master be killed

11:02.150 --> 11:03.540
before my eyes?

11:05.630 --> 11:07.060
I hope you can understand.

11:08.550 --> 11:09.450
And my master

11:11.000 --> 11:12.500
has his inner channels destroyed.

11:13.320 --> 11:14.210
He lives now

11:14.550 --> 11:16.730
only by a thread of qi within him.

11:17.030 --> 11:18.540
He won't last many days.

11:19.440 --> 11:20.090
Mr. Zhuo,

11:20.720 --> 11:22.500
why strike that final blow?

11:23.550 --> 11:24.660
A swordsman's death

11:26.550 --> 11:28.180
is not the body's death,

11:29.270 --> 11:30.780
but his sword-heart's.

11:31.840 --> 11:33.500
I've crushed Liu Yunqi's sword-heart.

11:33.790 --> 11:35.690
He can never wield a sword again.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.540
He is already dead.

11:39.270 --> 11:40.020
Yes.

11:43.000 --> 11:43.850
Thank you, Mr. Zhuo.

11:44.630 --> 11:45.850
We've actually met.

11:47.240 --> 11:47.930
Yes.

11:48.550 --> 11:49.850
When we stood against the Demonic Sect,

11:50.840 --> 11:52.300
I saw your swordsmanship.

11:53.150 --> 11:53.840
Since you've come

11:53.840 --> 11:55.090
under the name Zhuo Yue'an,

11:55.670 --> 11:56.850
then you are Zhuo Yue'an.

11:57.870 --> 11:58.780
I admire you.

11:59.910 --> 12:01.420
You're unlike your master.

12:02.030 --> 12:03.780
Your swordsmanship holds little malice.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.900
But you shoulder too much,

12:06.240 --> 12:07.850
so the blade can't follow your heart

12:09.150 --> 12:10.390
and you never reach

12:10.390 --> 12:11.690
your strongest state.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.420
Many have said the same.

12:15.150 --> 12:16.060
Since the elders

12:16.840 --> 12:18.210
entrusted Wushuang City to me,

12:19.320 --> 12:20.330
I've had to place

12:20.330 --> 12:21.540
its honor and shame

12:22.510 --> 12:24.260
on this very sword.

12:25.910 --> 12:27.420
Peerless Under Heaven...

12:28.670 --> 12:30.520
I heard the White-Feather Sword Deity

12:30.520 --> 12:31.820
once saved a disciple

12:31.820 --> 12:32.730
on Tianqi City's execution ground.

12:33.630 --> 12:34.450
As he left,

12:35.320 --> 12:37.090
he cut down the plaque above with one stroke.

12:37.870 --> 12:38.660
So today,

12:40.240 --> 12:40.970
if I sever these characters

12:41.120 --> 12:42.380
with one stroke,

12:42.750 --> 12:43.930
the name No-Sword City

12:45.000 --> 12:46.380
will once again ring through

12:46.480 --> 12:47.420
the martial world.

12:47.790 --> 12:48.450
Sir,

12:48.910 --> 12:49.970
please don't act rashly.

12:51.200 --> 12:51.850
Seven days from now,

12:52.150 --> 12:53.180
you and I will fight.

12:53.630 --> 12:54.500
If you lose,

12:54.910 --> 12:56.300
I'll cut them down.

12:56.750 --> 12:57.380
Very well.

12:57.720 --> 12:58.450
Seven days from now,

12:58.750 --> 13:00.420
by the Sword Abode behind Wushuang City,

13:00.910 --> 13:02.660
I'll see your swordsmanship.

13:03.720 --> 13:04.380
Good.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.140
This kid...

13:18.030 --> 13:18.900
After changing his name,

13:19.200 --> 13:21.180
he acts like a different man.

13:21.750 --> 13:23.500
Challenging Wushuang City was one thing,

13:24.030 --> 13:25.140
he even crippled

13:25.140 --> 13:26.180
the Old City Lord.

13:28.030 --> 13:29.090
Too arrogant!

13:29.840 --> 13:30.780
Too overbearing!

13:32.000 --> 13:32.580
Had he been like this earlier,

13:32.580 --> 13:33.930
we'd have crushed the three families already.

13:34.240 --> 13:34.900
Yeah.

13:35.720 --> 13:37.570
Muyu never liked the spotlight,

13:37.630 --> 13:38.330
but this time

13:38.390 --> 13:39.540
the whole world is talking

13:39.540 --> 13:41.260
about Zhuo Yue'an of No-Sword City.

13:43.910 --> 13:45.020
However...

13:46.790 --> 13:47.730
What?

13:49.480 --> 13:50.760
The move Muyu used

13:50.760 --> 13:51.750
at the last moment

13:51.910 --> 13:53.180
looked like the Eighteen-Sword Array.

13:53.790 --> 13:55.010
Back when we helped the sects

13:55.010 --> 13:56.330
resist the Demonic Sect's eastern campaign,

13:56.720 --> 13:57.840
Muyu once used

13:57.840 --> 13:59.090
that very array in public.

13:59.790 --> 14:02.500
So some folks are quietly saying

14:03.120 --> 14:04.970
that Zhuo Yue'an, No-Sword City's heir,

14:05.120 --> 14:06.300
is Blood River's Umbrella Ghost.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.320
But that guess

14:08.320 --> 14:09.330
is far too absurd,

14:09.840 --> 14:11.210
and many won't believe it.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.690
An assassin

14:16.870 --> 14:18.970
who walks the night and kills without a sound

14:19.270 --> 14:21.570
now shows up openly under the sun,

14:22.270 --> 14:24.420
even challenging a once-glorious sect...

14:26.670 --> 14:28.660
Sounds a bit like a tall tale.

14:29.750 --> 14:30.640
If he's finished the job,

14:30.640 --> 14:31.570
he should be back by now, right?

14:32.360 --> 14:33.060
Oh,

14:33.750 --> 14:34.660
maybe...

14:34.870 --> 14:36.060
he went straight back to Nan'an?

14:36.360 --> 14:37.020
No.

14:37.510 --> 14:40.060
Muyu set another duel with City Lord, Song Yanhui,

14:40.480 --> 14:41.970
a solo fight on Wushuang City's back mountain.

14:44.200 --> 14:45.730
Su Muyu's lost his mind?

14:47.150 --> 14:48.660
The City Lord of Wushuang

14:49.120 --> 14:50.690
won't be easy to handle.

14:51.200 --> 14:52.140
This time

14:52.240 --> 14:53.730
Muyu really caught the competitive bug.

14:54.720 --> 14:55.380
No.

14:55.960 --> 14:56.810
That's not what I mean.

14:58.790 --> 14:59.930
I mean,

15:00.600 --> 15:02.300
Song Yanhui is nothing

15:03.000 --> 15:04.140
worth waiting around for.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.450
When we fought the Demonic Sect,

15:06.480 --> 15:08.210
we'd already seen his skills.

15:08.790 --> 15:11.090
If he truly wants his sword to shake the world,

15:11.600 --> 15:13.450
why not head to Xueyue City

15:13.510 --> 15:14.780
and teach that brat a lesson?

15:18.000 --> 15:18.810
Still, this isn't bad either.

15:19.750 --> 15:20.730
Old pain

15:20.960 --> 15:22.660
should be cut off someday.

15:24.080 --> 15:24.690
Otherwise,

15:25.000 --> 15:25.910
he'll carry

15:25.910 --> 15:27.540
that grudge for life.

15:29.000 --> 15:29.780
And...

15:32.080 --> 15:33.420
I've been waiting for that day too.

15:35.360 --> 15:37.140
I've long known who he is,

15:37.550 --> 15:38.660
but he doesn't know

15:39.320 --> 15:41.420
who destroyed No-Sword City.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.810
From how he's moving now,

15:44.550 --> 15:46.020
he must've found out

15:46.510 --> 15:48.300
Wushuang City was behind it.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.300
Wushuang City is unworthy

15:50.550 --> 15:52.660
of "Peerless Under Heaven" long ago.

15:54.240 --> 15:54.850
Still,

15:55.670 --> 15:56.570
Liu Yunqi's defeat

15:57.670 --> 15:58.380
isn't the end.

16:00.270 --> 16:01.020
What else?

16:01.720 --> 16:02.850
Su Muyu and Song Yanhui

16:02.870 --> 16:03.660
agreed:

16:04.120 --> 16:04.970
four days from now,

16:05.360 --> 16:06.380
on Wushuang City's back mountain,

16:07.030 --> 16:07.730
they'll fight again.

16:20.750 --> 16:21.900
Maybe true vengeance

16:23.670 --> 16:25.140
would be to wipe out Wushuang City,

16:26.790 --> 16:27.850
but I won't,

16:31.080 --> 16:32.610
and I know you won't, Father.

16:35.810 --> 16:36.900
After all, Wushuang City

16:38.270 --> 16:40.210
isn't full of Liu Yunqi types.

16:42.200 --> 16:43.380
And killing to stop killing...

16:46.360 --> 16:47.610
never ends.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.330
You've done well,

16:52.150 --> 16:53.020
my son.

16:56.270 --> 16:57.180
Father...

16:58.200 --> 17:00.380
I don't want you living in hatred.

17:01.150 --> 17:02.180
Just be yourself

17:02.480 --> 17:04.090
after the debt here is paid.

17:04.830 --> 17:07.170
Don't shoulder those old grudges.

17:13.310 --> 17:14.300
Son, look.

17:15.660 --> 17:19.460
♪I almost lost myself...♪

17:20.240 --> 17:21.740
After tonight's moon sets in the west,

17:22.790 --> 17:23.500
tomorrow

17:24.510 --> 17:26.130
still brings a brand-new sunrise.

17:36.880 --> 17:37.650
Didn't expect

17:37.880 --> 17:38.610
that guy

17:38.880 --> 17:40.850
to really challenge Wushuang City.

17:41.750 --> 17:42.940
He challenges Wushuang City

17:43.400 --> 17:44.370
and fame follows.

17:45.310 --> 17:46.130
What are you so proud of?

17:47.310 --> 17:48.760
But Zhuo Yue'an...

17:49.090 --> 17:50.420
Who is he?

17:51.830 --> 17:52.500
I never heard of him.

17:53.510 --> 17:55.940
Zhuo Yue'an is Su Muyu.

17:57.070 --> 17:59.260
He was heir to No-Sword City.

17:59.880 --> 18:01.410
And if not for sudden calamity,

18:02.030 --> 18:02.890
when grown

18:03.510 --> 18:05.700
he'd surely have entered the Academy.

18:07.160 --> 18:08.300
Fate toys with us.

18:09.590 --> 18:10.220
So,

18:11.310 --> 18:13.220
you're going to watch the show?

18:16.070 --> 18:18.330
Going into Wushuang City as I am,

18:18.920 --> 18:20.130
if anyone recognizes me,

18:20.480 --> 18:21.610
it'll be big trouble.

18:23.750 --> 18:24.980
Then what are you excited about?

18:26.000 --> 18:27.090
Because this spectacle

18:27.750 --> 18:29.330
was egged on by someone.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.980
He wants to use Su Muyu's sword

18:32.310 --> 18:34.330
to spark chaos in Wushuang City.

18:35.140 --> 18:38.420
[Flying Tiger General's Residence]

18:39.160 --> 18:40.350
Wushuang City

18:40.880 --> 18:43.090
was once the foremost city.

18:44.240 --> 18:46.260
Its martial path may have declined,

18:46.750 --> 18:50.170
but in craft and devices, it's still second to none.

18:51.200 --> 18:53.700
We've eyed this fat prize for years,

18:54.510 --> 18:57.300
and it's time to swallow it.

19:01.000 --> 19:03.130
Ruled by a madman only craving victory

19:04.030 --> 19:06.260
and a fool shackled by trifles,

19:09.830 --> 19:11.170
the sky over Wushuang City

19:12.110 --> 19:13.700
is long due for a change.

19:15.270 --> 19:16.220
Only now

19:17.480 --> 19:19.460
we can ride Su...

19:20.480 --> 19:21.260
no...

19:25.000 --> 19:26.410
Zhuo Yue'an's rise.

19:28.110 --> 19:28.740
And then,

19:30.110 --> 19:30.890
that man

19:31.200 --> 19:32.370
can profit from it.

19:32.880 --> 19:33.460
Besides,

19:34.070 --> 19:36.410
he's a man of the court.

19:36.920 --> 19:37.700
You told me

19:37.830 --> 19:38.700
about this before.

19:39.270 --> 19:40.700
Earlier I wanted to send men to Wushuang City,

19:40.960 --> 19:41.850
and you stopped me.

19:42.480 --> 19:43.130
This time,

19:43.790 --> 19:44.540
what's the plan?

19:45.480 --> 19:46.890
What he didn't expect is,

19:47.750 --> 19:48.460
Su Muyu

19:48.640 --> 19:49.890
told me the fact

19:50.000 --> 19:50.610
that someone planned

19:50.680 --> 19:51.410
to use him.

19:51.720 --> 19:53.540
I've prepared in advance.

19:53.920 --> 19:56.300
Since he wants Wushuang City in chaos,

19:56.790 --> 19:57.610
fine...

19:58.350 --> 20:00.370
let's make it even messier.

20:02.110 --> 20:02.980
How?

20:04.720 --> 20:05.460
Guards.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.300
Your Highness.

20:08.110 --> 20:09.300
How goes Sihuai City?

20:09.750 --> 20:10.370
Our people have courted

20:10.590 --> 20:12.500
the City Lord's senior disciple for years.

20:13.110 --> 20:13.780
Frankly, the man

20:14.000 --> 20:15.130
is a brainless incompetent,

20:15.270 --> 20:16.020
easy to turn.

20:16.640 --> 20:17.330
As for the other one,

20:17.790 --> 20:18.500
he's out of seclusion

20:19.000 --> 20:21.020
and willing to lend us a sword.

20:21.310 --> 20:22.460
What of Su Changhe?

20:23.550 --> 20:24.700
Any sign of movement?

20:25.000 --> 20:26.610
The Blood River are truly secretive.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.020
We've found

20:28.160 --> 20:28.940
only scattered traces,

20:29.310 --> 20:29.980
but...

20:30.270 --> 20:32.060
they're surely heading toward Sihuai City.

20:41.270 --> 20:42.410
A contest of the Way of the Sword

20:42.440 --> 20:44.170
without a living Sword Deity,

20:44.790 --> 20:46.650
what's the fun in that?

20:51.030 --> 20:51.500
Very well.

20:51.880 --> 20:52.610
Then let's await

20:52.640 --> 20:53.940
the Sword Deities to gather

20:54.070 --> 20:55.130
at Wushuang City.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.980
The real game

21:07.200 --> 21:09.020
is about to begin.

21:11.030 --> 21:11.780
What matter?

21:12.510 --> 21:14.540
Su Muyu, head of Blood River's Su family,

21:14.750 --> 21:15.890
has challenged Wushuang City.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.370
He'll duel the City Lord,

21:18.510 --> 21:19.850
Song Yanhui.

21:25.480 --> 21:26.500
I hate you all,

21:27.550 --> 21:29.780
but that Ji Ruofeng isn't bad.

21:30.790 --> 21:31.410
Speak,

21:32.270 --> 21:33.090
what brings you

21:33.720 --> 21:34.460
this time?

21:34.920 --> 21:36.650
Our master has no business for you,

21:37.160 --> 21:39.300
only a bit of sport,

21:39.480 --> 21:40.370
lest you miss it.

21:41.000 --> 21:43.780
A sword-related spectacle.

21:44.790 --> 21:46.170
A worldly matter?

21:48.790 --> 21:49.500
Leader Lv!

21:51.720 --> 21:52.410
Master.

22:01.580 --> 22:05.140
[Zhao Yuzhen of Wangchengshan Sect]

22:06.830 --> 22:07.570
Honored guest,

22:08.160 --> 22:09.090
what news do you bring from afar?

22:09.830 --> 22:10.780
Greetings, Profound Sword Deity.

22:11.590 --> 22:12.940
Ji Ruofeng

22:13.160 --> 22:14.540
may have planted spies

22:14.880 --> 22:16.130
on my sect.

22:17.030 --> 22:19.300
My good disciple hasn't even left the mountain,

22:20.070 --> 22:22.130
nor sparred with anyone.

22:23.270 --> 22:24.410
Yet somehow,

22:24.720 --> 22:27.170
he's been dubbed the Profound Sword Deity.

22:27.270 --> 22:29.130
And my once-secluded

22:29.310 --> 22:31.560
Wangchengshan Sect

22:32.110 --> 22:33.260
knows no peace anymore.

22:34.110 --> 22:34.780
Master,

22:35.200 --> 22:36.260
don't be so fierce.

22:36.720 --> 22:37.570
He's a guest from afar.

22:39.550 --> 22:40.540
I'm ordered by our master

22:40.960 --> 22:42.300
to bring a message to the Profound Sword Deity.

22:43.160 --> 22:43.740
Speak, then.

22:44.110 --> 22:45.220
Su Muyu, head of the Su family,

22:45.510 --> 22:46.330
challenged Wushuang City.

22:46.960 --> 22:48.980
He fought the former City Lord, Liu Yunqi,

22:49.200 --> 22:49.780
and won.

22:50.400 --> 22:51.890
He then set a duel with the current City Lord,

22:52.200 --> 22:52.850
Song Yanhui.

22:54.030 --> 22:56.220
What has that to do with my sect?

22:56.880 --> 22:58.780
Go tell Ji Ruofeng this:

22:59.240 --> 23:01.410
if he makes trouble here again,

23:02.110 --> 23:03.260
I'll go to Tianqi

23:03.260 --> 23:05.020
and smash his Baixiao Hall.

23:07.000 --> 23:09.090
Master Ji wishes to invite you to watch?

23:11.240 --> 23:12.700
But I cannot leave this mountain.

23:13.090 --> 23:14.460
And surely the all-knowing Master Ji

23:14.720 --> 23:15.650
knows that.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.810
He's invited several other Sword Deities too,

23:18.510 --> 23:19.500
because he believes

23:19.790 --> 23:20.460
this duel

23:20.920 --> 23:22.190
may well birth

23:22.190 --> 23:23.650
another Sword Deity.

23:24.510 --> 23:25.370
If overnight

23:25.590 --> 23:27.220
the jianghu boast six Sword Deities,

23:27.790 --> 23:29.700
wouldn't that be something?

23:30.720 --> 23:31.940
Sword Deity...

23:34.880 --> 23:35.980
She'll go, no doubt.

23:36.830 --> 23:38.300
No one loves the sword like she does.

23:44.880 --> 23:45.500
Master...

23:59.590 --> 24:00.410
Very well.

24:01.240 --> 24:02.700
Decide for yourself.

24:20.030 --> 24:20.850
Tell Master Ji

24:21.350 --> 24:22.260
that I understand.

24:24.350 --> 24:25.060
Got it.

24:44.030 --> 24:44.700
Move.

25:02.590 --> 25:03.260
Spider Woman

25:03.350 --> 25:03.940
of Blood River...

25:04.350 --> 25:06.060
Baixiao Hall's intel is truly sharp.

25:06.480 --> 25:07.890
You pegged me at first glance.

25:08.720 --> 25:09.780
I heard you've been visiting

25:09.780 --> 25:11.170
Sword Deities everywhere,

25:11.960 --> 25:13.610
so I waited here.

25:14.480 --> 25:16.370
And I lucked out.

25:16.920 --> 25:17.540
So you came

25:17.590 --> 25:18.650
to buy news from Baixiao Hall?

25:19.070 --> 25:20.020
Pick any branch,

25:20.070 --> 25:20.740
pay and get what you want.

25:20.960 --> 25:21.650
Why block my path?

25:22.270 --> 25:23.260
As if I don't know.

25:24.830 --> 25:25.890
Your Baixiao Hall

25:26.110 --> 25:27.270
seems to have some dirty ties

25:27.270 --> 25:28.220
to the Inner Security Division,

25:29.160 --> 25:30.650
and certain news is never for sale.

25:31.440 --> 25:32.370
What you want to know

25:32.960 --> 25:33.570
is about...

25:33.680 --> 25:34.540
The Xuanwu Guardian,

25:36.440 --> 25:37.260
Tang Lianyue.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.700
If you won't share it,

25:41.160 --> 25:41.980
fine.

25:43.550 --> 25:44.300
I'll find a way

25:45.350 --> 25:46.980
to make you.

25:50.400 --> 25:50.810
Hey...

25:51.070 --> 25:52.610
Go ask your master.

25:53.200 --> 25:53.810
You'll get the antidote

25:54.510 --> 25:55.410
next time.

26:17.960 --> 26:18.500
Master.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.320
Yanhui.

26:19.320 --> 26:20.020
You're awake.

26:20.200 --> 26:21.740
Will you blame me?

26:23.450 --> 26:25.350
You wanted to roam the world

26:26.510 --> 26:28.890
as a knight-errant,

26:31.400 --> 26:32.730
yet I kept you

26:32.730 --> 26:34.780
here in Wushuang City,

26:35.830 --> 26:37.940
burdened you with its honor and shame.

26:42.270 --> 26:42.980
Master,

26:44.310 --> 26:45.020
is it

26:46.350 --> 26:47.980
really so important

26:49.550 --> 26:50.980
that Wushuang City be number one?

26:51.550 --> 26:53.570
But you are different.

26:55.270 --> 26:56.090
Yanhui,

26:56.960 --> 26:58.890
from the day I met you,

26:59.830 --> 27:00.780
I knew

27:01.750 --> 27:02.700
you could change

27:02.750 --> 27:03.980
all of this.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.300
You're no worse

27:05.440 --> 27:06.890
than any of them.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.940
You were born

27:10.510 --> 27:12.740
for the sword.

27:14.070 --> 27:15.700
But I often regret

27:17.000 --> 27:17.980
whether

27:19.550 --> 27:21.650
I pressed you too hard,

27:23.200 --> 27:24.410
leaving you unable

27:25.510 --> 27:27.330
to be as free as they are.

27:29.030 --> 27:30.430
In your sword-heart,

27:30.430 --> 27:32.130
you aren't as pure.

27:34.830 --> 27:36.890
You shouldn't have accepted his duel.

27:38.790 --> 27:39.460
Master...

27:39.640 --> 27:40.170
Master...

27:42.350 --> 27:44.260
You shouldn't have agreed to fight him.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.170
Do you understand?

27:48.310 --> 27:49.260
Master,

27:49.480 --> 27:50.570
don't get so worked up.

27:51.400 --> 27:52.090
Don't forget...

27:53.030 --> 27:54.260
I still have one trump move

27:54.310 --> 27:55.170
left unused.

27:57.510 --> 27:58.610
You mean...

27:59.510 --> 28:01.300
the Wither-Bloom Sword Art?

28:05.110 --> 28:06.540
You're being reckless.

28:07.160 --> 28:08.780
That will cost your life.

28:09.110 --> 28:09.980
I'll die,

28:11.200 --> 28:12.170
but I won't lose.

28:12.960 --> 28:14.020
With my death,

28:14.830 --> 28:16.650
I'll keep Wushuang City's honor.

28:17.750 --> 28:20.060
That's my duty as City Lord.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.540
Your disciple

28:25.480 --> 28:27.500
can open the Peerless Sword Coffer.

28:28.350 --> 28:29.390
Maybe let him...

28:29.390 --> 28:30.260
Master,

28:32.120 --> 28:33.780
Wushuang's still too young.

28:35.110 --> 28:36.060
As the teacher,

28:37.640 --> 28:39.300
I should go before my disciple.

28:41.880 --> 28:43.330
You did the same for me.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.060
Besides,

28:46.650 --> 28:47.620
I don't want Wushuang

28:47.620 --> 28:49.280
to walk my old path again.

28:51.310 --> 28:53.020
I want him to choose his own way.

28:57.510 --> 28:59.020
As for Wushuang City's future,

29:00.830 --> 29:02.940
leave it to the young.

29:05.830 --> 29:06.780
All right.

29:08.510 --> 29:09.460
Very well.

29:12.270 --> 29:13.850
Have it your way.

29:17.030 --> 29:18.260
All my life,

29:19.920 --> 29:23.700
I mostly did wrong.

29:24.510 --> 29:25.780
I hope you all

29:27.680 --> 29:30.170
won't repeat my mistakes.

30:14.140 --> 30:25.350
[All Blessings Attained]

30:25.350 --> 30:26.370
Master!

30:46.000 --> 30:48.090
Sihuai City's packed lately.

30:50.160 --> 30:51.020
Sects from everywhere

30:51.550 --> 30:52.610
are flooding in,

30:52.720 --> 30:53.410
too many to count.

30:54.310 --> 30:55.500
All want into the Tianxia Casino

30:56.110 --> 30:56.890
to get a Wushuang Token.

30:59.440 --> 31:00.610
Business must be booming, right?

31:02.350 --> 31:03.540
It was a big deal at first.

31:04.270 --> 31:05.260
But among the crowd

31:05.590 --> 31:06.780
are even great sect leaders

31:06.830 --> 31:08.410
and famed first-rate swordsmen.

31:08.920 --> 31:10.460
Selling so many tokens at once

31:10.920 --> 31:12.500
will cause a huge mess.

31:13.160 --> 31:13.810
We'll

31:14.590 --> 31:15.410
easily be exposed too.

31:16.350 --> 31:17.020
And now,

31:17.400 --> 31:19.020
the top experts wanting tokens

31:19.680 --> 31:20.650
are fewer and fewer.

31:23.110 --> 31:23.780
Why?

31:25.350 --> 31:27.260
They think too many of them are coming,

31:27.880 --> 31:29.650
so many Wushuang City can't stop them.

31:30.030 --> 31:30.740
With this many,

31:31.200 --> 31:32.060
they could storm a city.

31:32.440 --> 31:33.540
Why need tokens at all?

31:35.590 --> 31:36.300
When the time comes,

31:36.550 --> 31:38.330
the chaos will only grow.

31:42.270 --> 31:42.890
Who's there?

31:46.000 --> 31:46.610
Me.

31:47.830 --> 31:48.570
Master!

31:56.030 --> 31:57.220
Keep your dirty dealings hidden.

31:57.790 --> 32:00.220
If you expose yourself in Wushuang City,

32:01.110 --> 32:02.700
I won't be able to keep you safe.

32:12.100 --> 32:15.580
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

32:15.620 --> 32:19.500
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

32:21.340 --> 32:24.820
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

32:24.860 --> 32:28.700
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

32:30.700 --> 32:33.980
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

32:34.100 --> 32:36.180
♪Still I can't let go♪

32:36.340 --> 32:39.780
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

32:40.260 --> 32:42.460
♪My heart no longer my own♪

32:42.580 --> 32:47.580
♪No one can escape from love♪

33:04.180 --> 33:07.900
♪How many hidden feelings♪

33:08.020 --> 33:12.100
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

33:13.340 --> 33:17.220
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

33:17.340 --> 33:21.580
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

33:22.700 --> 33:25.580
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

33:25.660 --> 33:29.900
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

33:32.180 --> 33:36.180
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

33:36.220 --> 33:39.660
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

33:41.180 --> 33:44.620
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

33:44.700 --> 33:48.500
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

33:50.420 --> 33:53.860
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

33:53.900 --> 33:57.740
